(text "TPS26400 eFuse: UVLO 10.0 / 9.3 V and OVP 14.45 / 13.4 V from 107 k / 4.42 k / 10.0 k, R_ILIM 6.04 k (I_CB about 1.96 A), C_dVdT 100 nF, R_IMON 14.7 k, MODE open =\ncircuit breaker (CR-18). RTN (EFUSE_RTN) is never tied to GND_CTRL (A-C3). PWR_FLAG symbols state supply provenance for ERC; they do not prove voltage, current capacity\nor protection." (at 6.35 15.24 0)
